0.014326621,0.00006898609,-0.015939657,0.028416963,-0.05283792,0.050270718,0.044063874,-0.0012813593,0.04699074,0.06551813,0.06679396,0.055197634,-0.013381394,0.019759081,-0.009092683,0.041352924,-0.014531617,-0.0698497,-0.028615607,0.047277927,-0.017119555,-0.045238666,0.013383756,0.021518275,-0.008153504,0.032743048,-0.0029263012,-0.06422481,-0.087831676,0.0035879267,0.03810169,-0.003542356,0.012559189,0.08494641,-0.0030564046,0.07544198,-0.018072197,-0.054589517,-0.011066199,-0.006320764,-0.040834885,0.016901223,0.024715941,0.0053821173,-0.00395019,0.00071016507,-0.054405797,-0.03570746,-0.021894166,0.002616229,-0.02714583,0.0013860344,-0.07353009,-0.013686621,0.024467124,-0.01774241,-0.023374522,-0.0140657555,0.056776665,-0.0413311,0.021146325,-0.04111056,-0.007667412,-0.021043178,0.01193909,-0.04848041,-0.036492873,-0.039408375,-0.030034028,-0.040007077,0.06021074,-0.057398304,0.0063356035,-0.008711625,0.029769639,-0.00025149412,-0.043834705,0.036965378,0.0147679765,0.010255135,0.028927544,-0.07441682,0.015980748,0.034456022,-0.00003150909,-0.05061939,-0.0069063595,-0.0007559932,-0.02668811,0.010700049,-0.044434477,-0.010695684,0.06241193,0.024259401,0.012137707,-0.008571096,-0.0054939515,-0.057982586,-0.022793911,-0.039316233,0.03446749,0.01694852,-0.008872624,-0.014856289,-0.01343074,-0.012051113,0.031345617,-0.0022129396,-0.019102348,0.021203924,-0.037296437,-0.05030161,0.005856521,0.040725634,0.016974863,-0.007732318,0.025004564,0.12374158,0.026570657,0.033055436,-0.051848814,0.03764263,0.014202052,-0.009317854,-0.030958885,-0.013338235,-0.024714496],"hash":"f318ea42:1941","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-15T20:59:16.156Z\n- **User:** quero um plano para organizar as coisas agora que funcionou, to vendo mta coisa desorganizada em relacao a software, mt classe lingui;'ao que poderia ter subclasses objetos separados para ajudar na manutencao.\n- **Outcome:** Analisei o estado atual. O problema central: **PacketSniffer.cpp (1577 linhas) é um \"god file\"** com 6 responsabilidades misturadas, e há lixo morto. Aqui está o plano, em fases seguras (cada fase = 1 commit + build + teste em campo): ## Fase 0 — Limpeza (risco zero) - Apagar `src/PacketSniffer.cpp.new` (231 linhas, **não está no build** — build.bat:25 lista os .cpp e ele não aparece) - Corrigir comentários obsoletos: `AttackModule.h:34` ainda diz \"0xEFF5 ... ataques normais **E skill**\" (errado desde o fix do 0x19) ## Fase 1 — Extrair a criptografia (maior valor) Criar `src/MuCipher.h/.cpp` com **tudo que é cifra**, num lugar só: - `GameServerXorData` (o helper único de XOR que você pediu no turno anterior — sai de `static` e vira `MuCipher::XorData`, visível para qualquer módulo) - `GameServerEncryptLayer1` / `GameServerDecryptLayer1` / `FullEncrypt` / `FullDecrypt` - `GetGameServerKeys` + `GetMuHeaderSize` - `SimpleModulusCipher` já é classe separada — fica como está Resultado: qualquer pacote novo chama `MuCipher::XorData(buf, 3, len)` e decide C1 ou SM→C3. ## Fase 2 — Desmontar o god file PacketSniffer | Novo arquivo | Conteúdo (linhas atuais) | |---|---| | `WinsockHooks.cpp` | trampolines, `InstallInlineHook`, `HookSend/Recv/WSA*/Connect`, `Install/Uninstall` (~687–1140) | | `PacketReassembler.cpp` | buffers por socket, `ReadMuPacketLength`, `FlushReasmBuffer` (~502–600) | | `ControlSocket.cpp` | socket TCP do MuProxy2, threads connect/recv, `SendLine` (~57–330) — confe…\n- **Tools:** list_directory, run_command, lsp, search_files, read_file, glob","vector":[0.027943024,0.0602194,-0.15460451,-0.05080799,0.0448055,-0.06928835,0.0035185488,-0.0083435755,-0.09131997,-0.03104606,-0.0524469,-0.02447164,0.06454212,0.0030628575,0.024315542,-0.01444109,-0.022146434,-0.021792928,-0.103224866,0.012686093,0.05016331,-0.041941993,0.009935058,-0.009490581,0.09337641,0.06041027,0.008574517,-0.0014107836,-0.052124858,-0.016343264,0.062307935,0.03669839,0.014819091,-0.04