.030831143,0.032613177,-0.011261952,-0.03209078,0.011649905,-0.03050385,-0.03418468,-0.010339339,-0.014989752,-0.013752879,0.01587465,-0.059857562,0.014289239,0.011753026,0.02055726,-0.02681186,-0.0025005029,0.042227108,-0.0069903885,0.042017415,0.022309296,0.05702,-0.007531377,0.023531074,-0.014703981,-0.029722214,-0.0035955356,-0.047607154,-0.02443725,0.00026174664,-0.03992689,0.028464377,0.019353097,0.016418409,0.02650442,-0.044228967,0.010782539,0.04303185,0.03478875,-0.0041831075,-0.045303676,0.033435218,0.010404169,0.010510117,-0.0042245416,0.014706188,0.005821916,-0.022775058,-0.00024413528,-0.037442777,-0.02793456,0.029517947,-0.005262062,-0.009431029,-0.005063074,-0.02405372,-0.04393905,0.00033952083,-0.001616189,0.072475195,-0.011494629,0.03881994,-0.002936658,-0.04125229,-0.059190918,0.0013862499,0.040788308,0.00542337,0.0568247,-0.033862658,-0.04244307,0.011962437,-0.008514223,0.03593554,-0.015558654,0.02578227,0.15235068,0.019862238,-0.014044791,-0.07243355,0.024458962,0.035453007,-0.025473261,-0.020388113,0.0068800934,0.001798599],"hash":"fdc590db:1791","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-16T02:24:30.614Z\n- **User:** agora quero que vc implemente um auto potion, veja na doc o consumivel como funciona. e vai pensando como fazer.\n- **Outcome:** Implementado e commitado. Resumo: ## O que a doc do servidor (eMU `GameServer`) diz sobre o consumível ``` C1 06 26 <SourceSlot> <TargetSlot> <type> PMSG_ITEM_USE_RECV (opcode 0x26) ``` `CItemManager::CGItemUseRecv` → `CObjectManager::CharacterUsePotion`: - potions = `GET_ITEM(14,0..3)` (HP%), `14,4..6` (MP%), `14,35..40` (SD/compostas), `14,70/71/133` (elite) — efeito = % do `MaxLife`/`MaxMana`; - `SourceSlot == TargetSlot` → **rejeitado**; `type` só importa p/ Fruit; - **anti-hack**: 2º uso dentro de `CheckAutoPotionHackTolerance` ms é rejeitado **e a potion não é gasta** → precisa de intervalo mínimo; - o servidor **não** decide quando beber: o limiar é 100% client-side. **Achado de brinde**: o `SocketManager` do servidor decodifica `[3,size)` em ordem **decrescente** para *todo* pacote C1 → a Camada-2 vale para todos os opcodes (fecha a questão aberta do pacote de movimento na skill). ## Como ficou (byp.dll) | Peça | Onde | |---|---| | `MuCipher::UnXorData` | inverso da Camada-2 (ordem decrescente, como o servidor) | | `PipelineItemUse` | novo pipeline do `0x26` no `PacketInjector` | | `src/potion/AutoPotion.cpp` | watcher 100 ms lê life/mana da memória → injeta abaixo do limiar | | `POTION_START/STOP/CONFIG/STATUS` | comandos (MuProxy2: `PotionService` + grupo \"Auto Potion\" na UI) | **Learn & replay** (o slot do inventário do cliente não está mapeado — o `ObjectCharacter` só tem `pEquipment[12]`): o sniffer entrega o `C1 06 26` que o **jogador** mandou ao beber; o módulo…\n- **Tools:** read_file, list_directory, write_file, edit_file, search_files, manage_todos, run_command, memory","vector":[0.008470744,0.028623503,-0.16630416,-0.016034938,0.0201299,-0.08472782,0.04757408,-0.031784955,-0.037492815,0.018200567,-0.028620329,-0.0086928485,0.059811626,-0.020667097,0.023296263,0.02034331,-0.04266335,-0.07246814,-0.0562832,0.017361768,0.03373798,-0.058065806,-0.04114543,-0.007214927,0.07917249,0.055600755,0.012347561,0.06091166,0.0011539271,0.011441576,0.044236112,0.004296097,0.020521266,-0.011513776,0.03958996,-0.058042977,0.055494886,-0.00060305884,-0.027369805,0.03555081,-0.019825574,-0.018631784,0.05200197,-0.03770829,0.015104249,0.058149558,0.057337742,0.009218349,0.03445764,-0.10189717,0.0664788,-0.04842799,-0.019455254,-0.024268774,0.08917294,0.057149854,-0.024791889,0.013191487,0.040010363,-0.030193286,0.0902974,0.037469164,0.00014613806,0.0909655,-0.0026713766,-0.00016091927,-0.0494658,0.037598062,-0.035325397,0.035359353,0.06488556,-0.020455072,0.038634665,-0.019531205,0.031609472,-0.0044051292,-0.045134988,-0.0528052,0.018737653,-0.015983278,0.0035959037,-0.0089