Suas capturas revelaram a regra do caminho C3 ``` SM source = [serial] + innerC1[2..size] → numBytes = size-1 skill 0x19 : C1 07 19 … → [serial]+5 bytes → numBytes=6 item 0x26 : C1 06 26 … → [serial]+4 bytes → numBytes=5 ← uso de item vai DENTRO de C3! ``` ## 3. Correções (4 arquivos) | arquivo | mudança | |---|---| | `crypto/SimpleModulusCipher.cpp:245` | o checksum cobre **os mesmos 8 bytes** que a cifra usa (igual ao cliente nativo) | | `packets/PacketInjector.cpp` | pipeline **C3+SM genérico** (`SendC3Sm`)…\n- **Tools:** edit_file, search_files, run_command","vector":[0.039924398,0.049695116,-0.1433861,-0.047549494,0.024556799,-0.086579576,0.059584852,0.016592043,-0.050241224,-0.047899656,-0.053305298,0.024553835,0.07443109,-0.084782004,0.022582337,-0.028560061,-0.0039887535,-0.083163515,-0.025375383,0.038917255,0.021612655,-0.06146414,-0.031633977,-0.035457425,0.054866802,0.020404175,-0.0026149363,0.039802343,-0.054907832,-0.0057760095,0.091832235,-0.016468477,-0.011230419,-0.03040322,-0.024705688,-0.03105155,0.07783978,-0.007902973,-0.0103468,0.058984905,0.05123959,-0.040318947,0.008290948,-0.013837214,0.003294305,0.05837501,0.074725024,0.014795036,0.017220149,-0.081001446,0.013458038,-0.010957243,0.011644076,-0.0017964602,0.057356685,0.066482484,-0.030825488,0.025741452,0.010480726,-0.03567261,0.11021291,-0.017188316,0.012511204,0.069091015,0.041172277,-0.0016522874,-0.029483678,0.03521382,-0.013984472,0.017215708,0.049671,-0.023000551,0.07015879,0.000007909461,0.0019479137,-0.0024084772,-0.05014382,-0.027873239,0.010209992,-0.017578686,-0.004420158,0.0077119623,0.082319476,-0.066029534,0.004345397,0.009655507,-0.033939958,0.008508051,-0.05068435,0.086624674,-0.011571221,-0.021970144,0.035441212,-0.0050709643,-0.034642592,0.02320879,-0.016168695,0.03887618,-0.025883313,-0.003198105,-0.03597871,-0.0030189028,0.021268433,-0.0023841872,-0.0002753824,0.07487101,0.007424483,0.010202692,-0.017342815,0.025712488,-0.019499874,-0.009347375,-0.031043252,-0.037149303,0.