613996,0.01266945,0.035180148,0.007622269,0.018089147,-0.027557114,0.017397897,-0.0029032147,-0.006028989,-0.034606293,0.029072031,-0.026780954,0.0025151619,0.01647384,0.0489174,0.009465677,-0.024800085,0.022603124,0.013317738,0.010127552,-0.014234436,-0.049375314,0.025109595,-0.035500966,-0.0036491822,-0.009139342,-0.02765294,0.008471321,-0.020088809,0.016372552,-0.043835655,-0.051354993,0.046151984,0.00024434394,-0.007903336,-0.04059462,-0.0056061684,-0.041937888,-0.009358422,-0.008754078,0.033140063,-0.021917662,0.010749353,0.015295781,0.019227648,-0.044498146,0.013004013,-0.008812245,-0.028317556,0.059028607,-0.03949162,-0.022491336,0.03312259,0.009913424,-0.0108407615,-0.013875527,0.010998903,0.11079663,0.006912717,0.016162973,-0.05735846,0.040896766,0.03927487,0.0038096663,-0.08475344,-0.022943318,0.0021979606],"hash":"12fe6ff5:2144","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-16T11:53:54.531Z\n- **User:** [2026-11-16 03:50:17] [PACKETHANDLER] RECV linha (40): [POTION_CONFIG|hp=50|mp=30|interval=1000 ] [2026-11-16 03:50:17] [POTION] config: hp<50% mp<30% intervalo=1000ms hpslot=-1 mpslot=-1 hpitem=0xFFFFFFFF mpitem=0xFFFFFFFF [2026-11-16 03:50:17] [PACKETSNIFFER] recv() ret=15 socket=816 [2026-11-16 03:50:17] [PACKETHANDLER] RECV linha (14): [POTION_START| ] [2026-11-16 03:50:17] [POTION] auto-potion LIGADO (hp<50% mp<30% intervalo=1000ms) [2026-11-16 03:50:17] [POTION] estado: LIGADO | hp<50% mp<…\n- **Outcome:** **Diagnóstico do \"sem novidade\"**: o log foi truncado **depois** da conexão — a primeira linha é 03:50:11, mas o jogo abriu às **03:48:34**. Ou seja: os pacotes de login (character info + inventário) e as primeiras 60 linhas `S->C` foram pro ralo. O `POTION_STATUS` das 03:50:17 (life=0/0) é o estado *depois* da conexão, então o dado nunca chegou. **Mas tem uma boa notícia no teu log**: os `SMOD` com `checksum calc=0x35 expected=0x35` provam que **a decifração agora funciona** — aquele `C3Decoder` só roda quando `isGS==true`, e antes ele nunca disparava. A detecção por dados (em vez de porta) resolveu. ## O que mudei para não perder mais nada Novo módulo `src/packets/PacketDiag.cpp` (escrito à mão, registrado no `build.bat`): - **`F:\\blackrockmu\\gg_bypass2_s2c.log`** — arquivo **próprio, truncado a cada boot** (não depende do log principal): os 400 primeiros pacotes S→C em hex + o corpo decodificado dos C3 (SimpleModulus) + o **histograma de opcodes**. - O histograma sai **a cada 5s no log principal**: `S->C total=1234 | opcodes: 13=45 26=12 27=8 F3=3 ...` — isso responde de uma vez \"qual opcode o servidor usa de verdade\". - `AutoPotion`: os updates de life/mana agora são logados sempre (a cada 20º), o `fontes:` repete a cada 30s, e se um C3 não decodificar sai `C3 do servidor (len=N) nao decodificou (SimpleModulus)`. ## Teste agora 1. **Reinicia o jogo** (o build matou o `main.exe`). 2. Me manda **`F:\\blackrockmu\\gg_bypass2_s2c.log`** — é esse arquivo que tem o que importa (o…\n- **Tools:** read_file, write_file, edit_file, run_command","vector":[0.0017867094,0.027553739,-0.14275439,-0.048723508,0.03639873,-0.08246456,0.06420902,0.009197967,-0.02767901,-0.025499752,-0.06479451,0.05083804,0.07696168,-0.041610133,0.031525645,-0.0057577384,-0.054448266,-0.049124993,-0.07114689,0.01286889,0.03103559,-0.025744164,-0.03731385,-0.015057512,0.06427676,0.0370952,-0.013955063,0.04218976,-0.019847516,-0.032094214,0.0816057,-0.036112744,0.008666502,0.023334373,-0.023962373,-0.057408366,0.025350764,-0.044289406,-0.0029404764,0.05219906,0.023551362,-0.017400602,0.03045483,-0.014664745,-0.009159756,0.030288108,0.049258847,0.0344182,0.04533972,-0.0793075,0.037728053,-0.019149728,-0.01638337,-0.035499465,0.07597655,0.08696626,-0.037704397,0.03027056,0.03149938,-0.026787018,0.085596636,-0.014166043,-0.018219618,0.0733612,-0.0114913685,-0.030077191,-0.0450308,0.059116956,-0.028946254,-0.002822507,0.053230476,-0.003192782,0.02519865