do | |---|---| | **F3 10** | **lista de itens (INVENTÁRIO)** — enviada via `setE` = **C3+SM** ← por isso nunca aparecia em claro! | | F3 13 / 14 | equipamento / modificação de item | | F3 30 | option data (skill keys) | | F3 E0 / E1 | character info / **calc (é daqui que vem o maxLife ✓)** | | F3 E2 | health bar dos alvos | E corrigi a **chave de recepção**: o objeto que eu tinha achado tinha `Key = 0` (não era o objeto de decifrar). Agora o scan coleta **todos** os candidatos (3 variantes de chave cada: `Key`, inverso modular, `Key2`) e o **checksum do SimpleModulus decide** qual é a certa. ## Teste (build novo, `byp.dll` 04:31:36) 1. Reinicia o jogo (o build mata o `main.exe`). 2. **Bebe uma potion na mão** (1 vez). 3. Me manda as linhas `POTION`. O que eu espe…\n- **Tools:** search_files, read_file, edit_file, run_command","vector":[0.04287025,0.006434527,-0.1598796,-0.020321729,0.03706107,-0.05907856,0.064714596,-0.003493531,-0.08559541,-0.03256815,-0.05925259,-0.0043036435,0.0769895,-0.033363547,0.0072772177,-0.010128761,-0.049346056,-0.0698744,-0.049854424,0.059782304,0.009430387,-0.034834225,-0.01614092,0.008985679,0.08156905,0.039240554,-0.0061719907,0.04770022,-0.020196073,0.0013718507,0.035250455,0.04526422,0.020131338,-0.050123774,-0.0007338842,-0.056924764,0.06882397,-0.0062021194,-0.02980985,0.022375809,0.002652413,-0.06925647,0.029613156,-0.027562391,0.05370091,0.030606933,0.044217132,-0.008167947,0.0681051,-0.088760614,0.05506805,0.008769996,0.034357954,-0.037551258,0.08297767,0.01623857,-0.04003519,0.027948746,0.042331085,-0.051190183,0.090158746,0.00111686,-0.0037646056,0.051055115,0.01170352,0.007280066,-0.013360943,0.05226702,-0.031046746,0.0051131584,0.07493997,0.0017653025,0.06327979,0.005290288,-0.007870495,-0.009104083,-0.050474036,-0.026786394,0.0073372917,-0.015418872,-0.0006805867,-0.027716577,0.068538554,-0.061358158,0.04508897,0.0066348948,-0.045819163,-0.0026878368,-0.040078476,0.08211233,-0.030585423,-0.008895952,0.03065888,-0.008519314