334,-0.027653392,-0.01121313,0.03501935,-0.012901481,-0.020372856,0.026980871,-0.06618151,-0.03934057,-0.018104684,0.07075982,-0.0094459,0.0075383526,0.011035592,0.02090986,0.042582184,-0.00041391328,-0.031334393,-0.0010592208,0.046283085,-0.027574595,0.045866143,0.06616427,-0.02080123,0.017078767,0.09220842,0.07328375,0.037401482,0.008165719,0.010332865,0.005453729,0.009339553,-0.021727696,-0.055732585,-0.03983342,0.049246628,0.0063590687,-0.022494037,-0.060615294,0.037477203,-0.025339173,-0.02842165,-0.050584406,-0.049702168,-0.08462243,-0.012092565,0.030589176,-0.052730877,0.0015208318,0.0555348,0.035927564,0.09424521,-0.019006357,-0.052183215,0.013577998,-0.0007049378,-0.031017588,0.0126079675,0.030170491,-0.03899215,-0.031513568,-0.015712649,-0.03914271,-0.0135688735,-0.028440002,-0.0129386,-0.020852825,0.0373823,-0.05156414,-0.033468045,-0.0121029895,0.005594548,-0.01619495,-0.0107586235,0.040800836,-0.035822842,0.015203557,0.009877774,-0.0028414256,0.006295796,-0.018813647,-0.0074383877,-0.0018795412,-0.012218421,-0.04048039,-0.019074798,0.025670577,-0.033602282,0.015005885,0.021935672,0.015095696,0.03717288,-0.069869414,-0.030087644,0.050133392,-0.00031265573,-0.0078100883,-0.0462659,-0.034083374,-0.021584067,-0.014400411,0.013797637,-0.022936815,-0.010800131,-0.023557147,0.032296374,0.015556195,-0.022393936,0.06689857,-0.00038279782,0.0059811585,-0.027003936,0.021876082,-0.06579787,-0.028905645,-0.0553455,0.050838634,0.011255067,0.013034184,0.01830701,0.00883073,-0.049770266,-0.0029902838,0.017606605,-0.053070467,0.021522567,-0.032450363,-0.065150045,0.013458176,-0.0073776916,0.009161175,0.010844629,0.012183154,0.15894419,-0.008600468,-0.0073069516,-0.049272772,0.033610623,0.025754625,-0.022053758,-0.0393261,-0.00013951378,0.019739632],"hash":"34f69145:1722","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-16T13:16:09.739Z\n- **User:** apertei q o jogo simplesmente travou kkkk\n- **Outcome:** Kkkk não foi a potion — foi o **módulo de ataque**, e o culpado final era o **logger**. Já mataram os dois. ## O travamento (3 defeitos encadeados) **1. O log virou 69 MB** — `Logger::Log` fazia `fflush()` em **cada linha** e usava um `CRITICAL_SECTION` **global**. Como o logger é chamado *dentro* do hook de rede, a thread do jogo disputava esse lock com o spam de ataque. O jogo ficava esperando o lock → **\"congelou\"**. **2. O delay do ataque nunca era respeitado.** No `DispatcherThread` (AttackModule.cpp:390): ```cpp WaitForSingleObject(g_hNewMonsterEvent, g_SessionDelayMs); // ← o delay ``` O evento do watcher (\"novo monstro detectado\") **acordava o dispatcher na hora**. E o tracker de monstros *pisca* (`0x06E5 detectado` → `removido` → `detectado` a cada 150ms), então o evento era sinalizado várias vezes por segundo → **uma thread de ataque por monstro a cada sinal**. Medido: **4883 skill packets em 04:54**, ~5000 linhas/s. **3. 6 linhas de log por skill injetada** (2 no AttackModule + 4 no PacketInjector) → 30 MB/min. ### Correções - `Logger.cpp`: flush no máximo **1x/s** (o CRT bufferiza). O `fflush` por linha era o que segurava a thread do jogo. - `AttackModule.cpp`: **delay mínimo sempre respeitado** — o evento só *desperta*, o intervalo configurado manda. - Log do caminho quente com **throttle 1:20** + `Dispatcher: N rodadas em 5s` como visibilidade. - Truncatei o log de 69 MB (ficou 0 bytes). ## A potion: o mecanismo novo já funciona Do log da sessão que travou, ante…\n- **Tools:** search_files, edit_file, run_command, manage_todos","vector":[-0.00004628541,0.058177553,-0.15946548,-0.009105082,0.039807007,-0.06399588,0.031375676,0.016587513,-0.08670212,-0.021290364,-0.0823725,0.0050890557,0.09555546,0.009802454,0.026623877,-0.035608146,-0.0014647022,-0.023196448,-0.07270979,0.009798487,0.0013880831,0.009903767,-0.037525408,-0.032998558,0.062921345,0.033689953,0.014777636,0.05939215,-0.021071207,0.021846546,0.039439484,-0.018407296,