22,-0.03468512,-0.045926284,0.026429275,0.040787093,-0.020080468,-0.028168997,-0.03088778,-0.05438692,-0.03508249,-0.023404084,-0.0027180274,-0.002686189,0.018548766,-0.063549705,0.024512492,0.030496577,-0.008540915,-0.021426955,-0.015301221,0.064109236,-0.007337737,0.04636171,-0.0019004482,0.016390955,-0.027491884,-0.029186929,0.011560202,-0.021310288,0.007996049,-0.006834633,-0.028680764,0.003864181,-0.08825369,0.01009016,0.042427808,0.016918698,0.018194487,-0.05900622,0.021389676,-0.0085141305,-0.005596654,0.011072525,-0.050563063,-0.04368563,-0.009085546,0.011556422,0.0032435295,-0.01458561,-0.004888376,-0.020148601,0.036415953,-0.031050999,-0.03542735,0.052106187,0.0013011921,0.01873259,-0.043414693,0.029895542,-0.064982966,-0.014637277,-0.063993424,0.036428694,0.0032567915,0.038111426,0.013135752,0.0030966825,-0.035028663,-0.004422696,-0.024954941,-0.014025796,0.035804044,-0.025828911,-0.05997627,-0.0039491616,-0.029331237,0.01988786,-0.019790323,0.016446527,0.13988994,-0.011217185,0.012382227,-0.024311893,0.008464569,0.025171397,0.0069730836,-0.015073358,0.0034518398,-0.027065793],"hash":"4064fadd:1662","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## Resumo da Sessão (2026-11-16)\n\n**Refatoração concluída** — 9 commits (`c92afdc`…`6846467`), comportamento preservado. Módulos em `src/`/`src/include/`: `MuCipher`, `DebugTools`, `NameRewriter`, `PacketReassembler`, `PacketInjector`, `CommandChannel`, `PacketChannel`, `WinsockHooks`, `GameMemory`.\n\n**Correções locais não commitadas**\n- `SimpleModulusCipher::EncryptBlock` (checksum); auto-potion `C3+SM`; falhas em `GameMemory::Player::UserObject()`/`Character()`.\n- `src/include/SafeRead.h`: validação via `VirtualQuery`, aplicada a objetos, stats, `PartyList` e viewport.\n- Rede: `PacketSniffer.cpp::LogRaw()` não decifra duas vezes; `ReasmContext.isGameServer` usa estado real (restaura viewport, skill map, `AutoPotion::OnServerPacket()`).\n\n**Auto-potion / protocolos**\n- `C1 26/27` diferencia vida/mana atual (`0xFF`) e máxima (`0xFE`); `C3Decoder` notifica pacote interno; `OnItemUsePacket()` detecta `C1 06 26`; polling 100 ms; comandos `POTION_START/STOP/CONFIG/STATUS`.\n- `DecodeItemId` = `grupo*512 + idx`; learn por uso ainda não testado.\n- Protocolos confirmados: `C1 26/27`, `C1 F3 E1`, `F3 E0`, `F3 11`, `F3 E2`, `C1 11`. Chaves SM distintas send/receive; Obj1 (`0x87977778`) validada; busca pelo prefixo `0x00D546EC` para Obj2 (sem teste C3 real).\n\n**Diagnóstico/build**\n- `MuCipher.cpp::PeekDecodedPacketSize()` detecta headers MU; `GameServerConnection.cpp` identifica socket GS; `PacketDiag.cpp` no `build.bat`; log `F:\\blackrockmu\\gg_bypass2_s2c.log` (400 pacotes S→C). Build `byp.dll` com `/EHsc` e `/MAP`; debug TCP `44412`/`44413`.\n\n**Travamento do jogo (causado pelo módulo de ataque, não pela potion)**\n- `Logger::Log` fazia `fflush()` por linha + `CRITICAL_SECTION` global, Called dentro do hook de rede → lock dispute travava o jogo (log chegou a 69 MB).\n- Delay ignorado: evento do watcher acordava `DispatcherThread` (`AttackModule.cpp:390`) a cada ~150 ms → ~4883 skill packets em 04:54.\n- Correções: flush máx. 1x/s; delay mínimo sempre respeitado (evento só desperta); throttle de log 1:20 + `Dispatcher: N rodadas em 5s`. Log truncado para 0 bytes.","vector":[0.017994294,0.05040407,-0.16941617,-0.027653772,0.049589396,-0.082452215,0.05895202,0.016494393,-0.030598274,-0.029791225,-0.06949733,-0.0039851256,0.052458994,-0.01867956,0.015200303,-0.018722108,-0.029827073,-0.037226394,-0.06552656,0.016948758,0.024284158,-0.07113317,-0.049769916,-0.020087725,0.0768806,0.078631625,-0.016661398,0.032898698,-0.0352019,0.023318442,0.03263555,0.004487414,0.03436436,-0.039056417,0.037978314,-0.0366648,0.017979639,-0.03643685,-0.04213187,0.0016722488,0.00117562,-0.010028204,-0.008570546,-0.047513627,0.009996239,0.05657228,0.030239465,0.0005978729,0.05193169,-0.08841918,0.045964833,0.00456838