4455,-0.036748778,0.0516142,0.016015707,0.018563319,-0.030544382,-0.008323043,-0.020143773,-0.0041557266,-0.0001900827,-0.023187825,-0.026988441,-0.000431713,-0.012750455,0.052214544,0.020971227,0.025346832,-0.0066971947,-0.038221303,0.0077737137,-0.011164685,0.017895551,-0.0010407306,-0.047161084,-0.030869339,-0.00833444,-0.034355722,0.01702174,-0.021708237,0.04318326,-0.023309186,0.013800651,-0.044569813,-0.029207462,0.07751915,0.024255043,0.0007866008,-0.048786264,0.0041450313,-0.025164342,0.008484101,-0.0706689,0.017350685,-0.012719318,0.003114911,0.026157606,0.0038647049,-0.02181397,0.061262984,-0.0018628428,-0.036059875,0.0314735,-0.047123693,-0.04928409,0.033176195,-0.01632201,0.013636411,0.0014871684,0.031748466,0.16235209,0.012481781,0.042313997,-0.025933772,0.025675148,0.02663062,-0.028675789,-0.061693877,-0.039806977,-0.018025411],"hash":"28aafe81:341","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-16T13:37:45.265Z\n- **User:** ta rodando mas nao ta funcionando rs...\n- **Outcome:** Achei a causa raiz de verdade, olhando o **dump cru dos pacotes**. ## Por que não funcionava O servidor BlackRock **não manda o life/mana máximo em nenhum pacote**. Conferi todos os 464 pacotes do `gg_bypass2_s2c.log`: | pacote | o que traz | |---|---| | `C1 26` (life) | só o valor **ATUAL** (type `0xFF`) — 6 no total | | `C1 27` (mana) | só o valor **ATUAL** — 17 no total | | `F3 E5` / `E2` / `FC` / `F1` | posição, alvo, ping — **nada de life** | | `F3 E0` / `E1` / `03` | **não existem** nesse servidor | Sem o máximo, `life/maxLife` dá `-1%` → o limiar nunca era avaliado. Era por isso que o log mostrava `DECISAO: life=202/0 (-1%)`. Confirmei também no source do cliente (`Main_EX603/Main/Protocol.cpp`) que `0xFE` = máximo e `0xFF` = atual (o fix anterior está certo) — e que o **cliente tem o máximo**: `PrintPlayer.cpp` declara os globals da HUD **consecutivos**: ```cpp DWORD ViewIndex, ViewReset, ViewValue, ViewPoint; DWORD ViewCurHP, ViewMaxHP, ViewCurMP, ViewMaxMP; DWORD ViewCurBP, ViewMaxBP, ViewCurSD, ViewMaxSD; ``` ## O que fiz **`src/game/GameMemory/ClientVitals.cpp`** (novo): varre as seções graváveis do `main.exe` procurando esse bloco, usando **4 assinaturas independentes** vindas da rede (life, mana, BP e escudo — o BP é 160 fixo nesse servidor). Quatro valores casando = identificação praticamente única. Depois disso o byp lê o HP/MP **direto do cliente** (sem atraso de rede). **`AutoPotion.cpp`**: os vitais do cliente viram a fonte primária; rede/calc ficaram como …\n- **Tools:** read_file, search_files, write_file, edit_file, run_command, manage_todos","vector":[0.051720217,0.03819617,-0.17333104,-0.03085916,0.04772795,-0.07908049,0.070366725,-0.01002622,-0.06954258,-0.020535344,-0.04721361,-0.000368019,0.03799958,-0.0435201,0.03158594,-0.046616707,-0.015296186,-0.054744177,-0.046686612,0.0051875575,-0.003595939,-0.054193944,0.00096782576,0.010641604,0.07603508,0.050445918,-0.015337223,0.09719044,-0.0491936,-0.028954284,0.035621036,0.040035978,0.0025591129,-0.021437403,-0.014771005,-0.0070748776,0.08749564,0.017490635,0.019365525,-0.028967083,0.013481649,-0.09614587,0.03303119,-0.00798844,0.009491402,-0.027484966,0.040023528,0.018244063,0.05903016,-0.08784291,0.05122,0.019497065,0.018741038,-0.024034174,0.08519935,0.01885669,-0.029695477,0.026557842,-0.0066539375,-0.049901564,0.09114915,0.026157377,0.01725963,0.09106008,0.025852883,-0.02819169,-0.02348133,0.0034258915,-0.043807033,-0.0012821759,0.038922247,-0.0058162324,0.050284706,-0.0037870165,0.007269079,0.006300033,-0.044929404,-0.006413914,-0.017281298,-0.011181076,0.023655118,-0.024537351,0.08717393,-0.04066174,0.050508462,0.01950052,0.0011303499,0.017735194,-0.05570927,0.09413623,0.017390948,-0.020209242,0.053052124,0.0064998292,-0.07722087,0.04290987,-0.04413941,0.03881381,-0.008164569,-0.0011966137,-0.030948376,-0.0209707,0.036048006,-0.03038138,0.028101768,0.028449384,0.01594010