.011393041,-0.068221115,-0.03645428,0.041184988,-0.00074738206,-0.041712366,-0.04491226,0.035699844,-0.023760766,-0.009363482,-0.006066925,-0.064027175,-0.066053994,0.009994353,0.04535763,-0.05576658,-0.0011656433,0.07363131,-0.024604445,0.07323725,-0.004416629,-0.031933468,-0.021046666,0.01248461,-0.04850937,0.02705572,0.07219513,-0.03381654,-0.030952897,-0.035012413,-0.024125993,-0.020978555,-0.01691855,-0.02219055,-0.057248037,0.0060666082,-0.02079432,-0.027363267,-0.013001471,-0.011429188,-0.015098671,-0.020774703,0.050553113,-0.030073954,0.035177648,0.011901809,0.024567835,-0.0018424005,-0.019352684,0.0075336546,0.0012896797,-0.0263038,-0.06719125,-0.05370013,0.044079207,-0.025788527,0.01297526,0.018032977,0.033206552,-0.019108409,-0.05902751,-0.032482103,0.005917072,-0.009788668,0.0004000957,-0.0694901,-0.016207725,0.011451029,0.004187716,0.00156832,-0.0046518315,0.023745503,-0.00003482644,0.017508399,-0.01520845,-0.03453859,0.049103588,-0.012343347,0.010482878,0.006170837,-0.013989392,-0.045655105,0.003347446,-0.04534502,0.04049778,0.015656175,0.012343672,0.037299223,-0.004976752,-0.06588394,-0.0016812191,0.019553397,-0.020099146,0.041015647,-0.032459397,-0.05323239,0.0042689056,0.013535038,0.014334743,-0.02982904,0.017679408,0.15194641,0.016546315,0.0058301077,-0.025941353,0.024976643,0.024094127,0.015545317,-0.05753991,-0.020216346,0.027548883],"hash":"ee9bba8c:1829","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## Consolidated Summary (updated 2026-11-16T15:34:06.331Z)\n- **Refatoração concluída** em 9 commits (`c92afdc`…`6846467`), reorganizando `src/` e `src/include/` (`MuCipher`, `DebugTools`, `NameRewriter`, `PacketReassembler`, `PacketInjector`, `CommandChannel`, `PacketChannel`, `WinsockHooks`, `GameMemory`), sem alterar comportamento.\n- **Correções locais ainda não commitadas:** checksum de `SimpleModulusCipher::EncryptBlock`; auto-potion `C3+SM`; falhas em `GameMemory::Player::UserObject()`/`Character()`; `src/include/SafeRead.h` com `VirtualQuery`; `PacketSniffer.cpp::LogRaw()` sem decifração duplicada; `ReasmContext::isGameServer` usa estado real e restaura viewport/skill map.\n- **Auto-potion:** `C1 26/27` distingue HP/MP atual (`0xFF`) e máximo (`0xFE`), mas o servidor BlackRock envia apenas valores atuais. `src/game/GameMemory/ClientVitals.cpp` localiza vitais na HUD do `main.exe` por assinaturas; `AutoPotion.cpp` usa esses valores como fonte primária. Comandos `POTION_START/STOP/CONFIG/STATUS`, polling de 100 ms. `DecodeItemId = grupo*512 + idx`; learning por uso ainda não foi testado.\n- **Protocolos/criptografia:** confirmados `C1 26/27`, `C1 F3 E1`, `F3 E0`, `F3 11`, `F3 E2` e `C1 11`; chaves SM distintas send/receive; Obj1 (`0x87977778`) validado. Obj2 (`0x00D546EC`) ainda sem teste C3 real.\n- **Diagnóstico/build:** `PeekDecodedPacketSize()` reconhece headers MU; identificação do socket GS em `GameServerConnection.cpp`; `PacketDiag.cpp` incluído no `build.bat`; `byp.dll` compilado com `/EHsc` e `/MAP`; log em `F:\\blackrockmu\\gg_bypass2_s2c.log`.\n- **Travamento corrigido:** era causado pelo módulo de ataque, não pela potion. `Logger::Log` bloqueava no hook por `fflush`; watcher ignorava delay e disparava `DispatcherThread` em `AttackModule.cpp:390`. Flush reduzido, delay respeitado e throttle 1:20.\n- **Pendências:** recompilar/implantar em `F:\\blackrockmu\\`; testar com o jogo parado; confirmar life/mana via `ClientVitals`, Obj2 e `XorData`; revisar `0x59C725`, `0x404E34`, `Main.dll:0x67D68330`; escolher `InjectSkillC1` ou `InjectC1Attack` (`AttackModule.cpp:207`); reduzir logs `[SM] DecryptBlock`; testar learning da potion e commitar correções.","vector":[0.033302527,0.046148144,-0.17546782,-0.023451917,0.046217743,-0.08641817,0.067150764,-0.0098572085,-0.05455982,-0.04223537,-0.05355901,0.021447333,0.041946873,-0.024317846,0.012076489,-0.030808603,-0.028838454,-0.026507054,-0.050498355,0.013062021,0.026217693,-0.0