030331013,-0.02283345,-0.01887945,0.04050257,0.0029965627,0.015985481,0.011256005,-0.030077897,0.07013007,-0.0037884132,0.016493605,0.0047302665,-0.021272384,-0.04606304,0.018776774,-0.07046579,0.059415907,-0.005418985,0.0050455187,0.019098405,0.0039243884,-0.055310883,-0.018628899,0.0061445264,-0.041223075,0.03331985,-0.05234919,-0.035810653,0.033159878,-0.0050790873,0.02497195,-0.014907405,0.026172647,0.12986329,0.006171929,0.008131432,-0.01100967,0.021623977,0.024736458,-0.015907476,-0.058218405,-0.012746081,0.01898118],"hash":"80261915:1634","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":false},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-16T14:31:45.862Z\n- **User:** a ui nao deveria acompanhar a change? rs\n- **Outcome:** Você tem razão — mudança sem UI é mudança pela metade. Implementei a **Fase 6** agora. ## O que a UI ganhou **Nova mensagem byp → UI** (canal de comandos, 1x/s): ``` POTION_STATE|active=1|hp=12|hpSrc=inv|mp=39|mpSrc=inv|items=47|life=202|lifeMax=214|mana=14|manaMax=219|warn= ``` **Novo painel** no grupo \"Auto Potion\" (`lblPotionState`, borda fina, 2 linhas): ``` HP 202/214 (94%) slot 12 (inv) MP 14/219 (6%) slot 39 (inv) LIGADO | inventario: 47 item(ns) ``` E quando falta potion, a `warn` vem preenchida e **o painel fica vermelho**: ``` HP 202/214 (94%) slot - (-) MP 14/219 (6%) slot 39 (inv) LIGADO | inventario: 47 item(ns) | ATENCAO: sem HP ``` O `hpSrc`/`mpSrc` dizem a **origem** do slot: `inv` (inventário, automático), `cfg` (configurado à mão), `id` (por ID de item), `apr` (modelo aprendido), `-` (nenhum). **Por que isso importa:** com o painel, você vê na hora se o byp \"está vendo\" o dano. Se o HP travar em 100% enquanto o jogo mostra 50%, o problema é de leitura de vitais; se aparecer `slot -` e `ATENCAO: sem HP`, é falta de potion no inventário (ou o `F3 10` não chegou). ## Arquivos tocados nesta fase | Arquivo | O quê | |---|---| | `src/potion/AutoPotion.cpp` | `SendStateToUi()`, `ResolveSlot()` (prioridade: manual → inventário → ID → aprendido), `SlotSource` | | `Protocol/Messages.cs` | `PotionStateMessage` (tag `POTION_STATE`) | | `Services/DllCommandService.cs` | evento `OnPotionState` + dispatch | | `MainForm.cs` | `UpdatePotionState()` + assinatura | | `MainForm…\n- **Tools:** read_file, search_files, edit_file, run_command, manage_todos","vector":[0.008583712,0.048427463,-0.14557387,0.00001630537,0.042191442,-0.085282125,0.034294274,-0.033315048,-0.03393867,0.00089380983,0.0037544507,0.027890332,0.08416094,-0.0073605496,0.04906999,0.01854118,-0.01650839,-0.02943056,-0.049036752,0.04573928,0.02329957,-0.048740815,-0.07135925,0.0016846259,0.07906338,0.03923588,0.0058167707,0.05780996,-0.018754348,0.02704819,0.05167259,0.021865394,0.042864546,-0.02148665,0.009532993,-0.026053946,0.066486694,-0.050801273,0.061740182,0.030640401,-0.01715836,-0.061872363,0.021962736,0.00022595242,0.033928845,0.02727261,0.05426895,0.0043098624,0.033496592,-0.061954997,0.03594852,-0.015653493,-0.0019616308,-0.026122918,0.063440375,0.08502557,-0.03408892,0.0527226,0.07428181,-0.0069523556,0.07595214,0.018050062,-0.015129547,0.110939614,0.01346861,0.005775569,-0.027126294,0.021316195,-0.025174597,0.042112194,0.011493716,0.014074166,0.024262013,-0.024882372,-0.0032957352,0.016077472,-0.04878763,-0.061614286,-0.0010180584,0.024460433,-0.009002962,-0.005205621,0.12450643,-0.06315508,0.057961594,-0.042438872,0.013830168,0.040895123,-0.050827045,0.077339225,-0.0045486176,-0.04283713,0.037560932,0.023419384,-0.055464663,-0.0007287778,-0.06712965,0.015162647,-0.028781388,-0.02413003,-0.008285135,-0.029988036,0.018543385,-0.008383677,-0.0058197794,0.04512503,-0.018465035,0.015805766,0.021106932,-0.039311573,0.004979231,0.02627706,-0.020901464,-0.075697854,0.03127953,-0.048333902,0.064087704,-0.012592865,0.00078255305,0.019206217,-0.036808178,0.007790414,0.0074323174,0.083405524,0.08883296,0.016044678,-0.04392305,0.02110815,0.038366966,-0.061324123,-0.0012034562,-0.02024588,-0.08283