807,0.011951328,-0.005625616,-0.01785354,-0.020663602,-0.01096625,-0.06083212,-0.035455264,-0.040881395,0.02930927,-0.03460805,-0.009782482,-0.007120795,0.019510215,-0.02338263,-0.054348942,-0.021058463,0.0010476735,0.027542567,-0.02436862,-0.05539522,-0.04494051,0.0051554297,0.0058420324,0.018102443,-0.010835302,-0.021749713,-0.00094828976,0.026678486,0.0011232062,-0.037251297,0.060156748,0.004325371,0.0066400478,-0.022515893,-0.025822558,-0.06540318,-0.043693397,-0.055279717,0.010678882,0.006212226,0.025910031,0.019629195,-0.0064727976,-0.01868186,-0.024313767,0.0015830002,-0.03265797,0.016850833,-0.021920718,-0.052035846,-0.015161319,-0.005290135,-0.019229446,0.02448551,0.02093395,0.11941748,0.020947665,-0.0001641607,-0.04620397,-0.020851279,-0.0026591881,-0.019859202,-0.053999603,-0.0039983974,0.005253927],"hash":"d5ea392a:1933","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":false},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-16T15:30:22.173Z\n- **User:** oq o botao status faz?\n- **Outcome:** O botão **Status** manda um `POTION_STATUS` pro byp, que chama `LogStatus()` (`AutoPotion.cpp:1305`) e despeja um **snapshot do módulo no log do byp** (`F:\\blackrockmu\\gg_bypass2.log`, tag `POTION`): ``` [POTION] estado: LIGADO | hp<50% mp<30% intervalo=1000ms | modelo HP=- (slot 0) | modelo MP=- (slot 0) | life=214/214 (100%) mana=219/219 (100%) [POTION] slots automaticos: HP=30 (de 2) MP=-1 (de 0) | inventario=43 item(ns) [POTION] inventário conhecido: 43 item(ns) [POTION] vitals: life=214/214 mana=219/219 (fonte: servidor) ``` Na UI ele só escreve `[POTION] STATUS solicitado (resposta no log)` — o `Logger` do byp escreve **só em arquivo**, não no painel. O que ele mostra que o painel **não** mostra: - o **modelo aprendido** (`modelo HP=ok (slot 30)`) — o learn & replay do learn & replay; - o **slot manual / item ID** configurado por cabo (agora não existe mais pela UI, mas o protocolo aceita); - a **fonte dos vitais** (`servidor` / `cliente` / `memoria` / `party-list`) — importante pra diagnosticar \"o byp não está vendo o dano\". Ou seja: é um botão de **diagnóstico**, não de controle. O que eu uso pra investigar. Se quiser, eu tiro — o painel já mostra life/mana, slot, nome da potion e o aviso. Mas se preferir manter, dá pra melhorar: fazer o byp responder o status **também no painel da UI** (via `CommandChannel`), em vez de só no arquivo. Fala qual.\n- **Tools:** search_files, read_file","vector":[0.011503613,0.05125283,-0.1393704,-0.011741327,0.058896467,-0.083078206,0.056552667,-0.015110321,-0.03512326,-0.02779623,-0.029073963,0.031634007,0.06858725,-0.054658264,0.02926215,-0.03226278,-0.027011225,-0.0634981,-0.055498973,0.010092697,0.02277648,-0.020569619,-0.059243716,0.030294461,0.059952315,0.054580186,-0.03278031,0.0665067,0.0035388554,0.002227463,0.052904326,0.0123630315,0.0056443983,-0.016161466,-0.01983539,-0.035574272,0.0642575,0.011322564,0.035966173,0.028820185,0.034419026,-0.04585598,0.03605971,-0.009340692,0.013171002,0.03908891,0.044163037,0.015401713,0.027787035,-0.050935317,0.056447193,0.0026654315,0.012876642,-0.042617507,0.11931601,0.07005143,0.0017732602,0.018524393,0.022769995,-0.004565371,0.09791787,0.046101883,0.0005389822,0.12429349,0.008029923,-0.025242016,-0.028878465,0.045471046,-0.03735491,0.010146985,0.011723494,0.022199377,-0.0042740726,-0.018150525,-0.013880413,0.024697915,-0.035157736,-0.021431465,-0.0054931086,0.036161367,0.0160825,0.012110673,0.10163398,-0.055724744,0.040165603,-0.047598653,-0.022998456,0.008527675,-0.042406023,0.09033344,0.005184883,-0.01959142,0.061407596,-0.011179442,-0.040484257,0.042916074,-0.028935647,-0.0053142305,-0.04952534,-0.040288556,-0.022150539,-0.017503211,-0.022441465,0.0033101419,0.017683286,0.04831071,0.0047421986,0.015054433,-0.04124407,-0.012806346,-0.014999817,0.03503924,-0.013673438,-0.021426806,0.010641245,-0.037949212,0.027589777,-0.0005258338,-0.011776687,0.03586342,-0.017650051,0.016126327,-0.0077813235,0.06067555